---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-paraguay-home" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb">Hacé Cuentas / Paraguay</div><div class="hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Paraguay · datos oficiales 2026</div><h1>Las cuentas de todos los días, en guaraníes.</h1><p class="lead">Salario, IPS, aguinaldo, IRP, IVA, auto y vivienda. Herramientas hechas para Paraguay, con reglas locales y resultados claros.</p><div class="hero-search"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="¿Qué necesitás calcular?"><button id="searchBtn">Buscar</button></div></div><div class="flag-card"><div class="flag"><span class="seal">PAZ Y<br>JUSTICIA</span></div><div class="data-card"><small>SALARIO MÍNIMO 2026</small><strong>Gs. 3.044.000</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="quick wrap" id="quick"><div class="quick-grid"><div class="quick-form"><h2>¿Cuánto te queda del sueldo?</h2><p>Cuenta rápida con aporte obrero IPS del 9%.</p><div class="quick-fields"><div class="qfield"><label>Salario bruto mensual</label><input id="salary" type="number" value="3044000"></div><div class="qfield"><label>Hijos con bonificación</label><input id="children" type="number" min="0" value="0"></div><button class="calcbtn" id="salaryBtn">Calcular</button></div></div><div class="quick-result"><small>SUELDO NETO ESTIMADO</small><strong id="salaryNet">Gs. 2.770.040</strong><span id="salaryDetail">IPS: − Gs. 273.960 · sin bonificación familiar</span></div></div></section>
<section class="main"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Más usadas en Paraguay</div><h2>Empezá por la cuenta que necesitás.</h2></div><p>Filtrá por tema o escribí arriba. Todas usan guaraníes y normativa paraguaya.</p></div><div class="filters"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">Todas</button><button class="filter" data-filter="trabajo">Trabajo</button><button class="filter" data-filter="impuestos">Impuestos</button><button class="filter" data-filter="finanzas">Finanzas</button><button class="filter" data-filter="hogar">Hogar y auto</button></div><div class="cards" id="cards">
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="trabajo" data-search="salario sueldo neto ips"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">₲</span><span class="tag">TRABAJO</span></div><h3>Sueldo neto</h3><p>IPS, horas extra y bonificación familiar.</p><button class="open" data-page="Sueldo neto Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="trabajo" data-search="aguinaldo trece sueldo"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">12</span><span class="tag">TRABAJO</span></div><h3>Aguinaldo</h3><p>La doceava parte de todo lo percibido.</p><button class="open" data-page="Aguinaldo Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="trabajo" data-search="liquidacion final despido indemnizacion"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">✓</span><span class="tag">TRABAJO</span></div><h3>Liquidación final</h3><p>Preaviso, vacaciones e indemnización.</p><button class="open" data-page="Liquidación final Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="trabajo" data-search="ips jubilacion aportes"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">+</span><span class="tag">IPS</span></div><h3>Aportes y jubilación IPS</h3><p>Obrero 9%, patronal 16,5% y proyección.</p><button class="open" data-page="IPS Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="impuestos" data-search="irp impuesto renta personal"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">%</span><span class="tag">IMPUESTOS</span></div><h3>IRP</h3><p>Umbral Gs. 80 M y escala 8%, 9%, 10%.</p><button class="open" data-page="IRP Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="impuestos" data-search="iva 10 5 impuestos negocio ire"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">IV</span><span class="tag">IMPUESTOS</span></div><h3>IVA e impuestos</h3><p>IVA general, reducido, IRE e IDU.</p><button class="open" data-page="Impuestos Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="finanzas" data-search="guaranies dolar real cambio moneda"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">$</span><span class="tag">FINANZAS</span></div><h3>Guaraníes y dólar</h3><p>Conversión USD, BRL y ARS con referencia BCP.</p><button class="open" data-page="Guaraníes y dólar">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="finanzas" data-search="presupuesto familia viaje"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">≡</span><span class="tag">FINANZAS</span></div><h3>Presupuesto familiar</h3><p>Ordená gastos, ahorro y viajes.</p><button class="open" data-page="Presupuesto familiar Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="hogar" data-search="auto patente combustible mantenimiento"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">◫</span><span class="tag">AUTOMOTOR</span></div><h3>Tener un auto</h3><p>Combustible, patente, seguro y mantenimiento.</p><button class="open" data-page="Tener auto Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
<article class="calc-card" data-cat="hogar" data-search="casa vivienda credito cuota propia"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">⌂</span><span class="tag">VIVIENDA</span></div><h3>Casa propia</h3><p>Entrega, cuota, interés y costo total.</p><button class="open" data-page="Casa propia Paraguay">Calcular ahora →</button></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="facts"><div class="wrap facts-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Paraguay 2026 de un vistazo</div><h2>Los valores que alimentan las cuentas.</h2><p>Datos de MTESS, IPS, DNIT y BCP. Visibles para que sepas exactamente qué usa cada resultado.</p></div><div class="fact-list"><div class="fact"><span>Salario mínimo mensual<small class="source">MTESS · Decreto 6225</small></span><strong>Gs. 3.044.000</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Aporte obrero IPS<small class="source">IPS</small></span><strong>9%</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Aporte patronal IPS<small class="source">IPS</small></span><strong>16,5%</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>IVA general / reducido<small class="source">DNIT · Ley 6380/19</small></span><strong>10% / 5%</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>IRP · umbral anual<small class="source">DNIT</small></span><strong>Gs. 80.000.000</strong></div><div class="fact"><span>Dólar de referencia<small class="source">BCP · 24-jul-2026</small></span><strong>Gs. 6.050,25</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="needs"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Entrá por tu situación</div><h2>¿Qué querés resolver hoy?</h2></div></div><div class="need-grid"><button class="need" data-filter-jump="trabajo"><span class="need-icon">▣</span><b>Entender mi recibo</b><span>Sueldo, IPS, horas extra y aguinaldo.</span></button><button class="need" data-filter-jump="impuestos"><span class="need-icon">%</span><b>Saber qué impuesto pago</b><span>IRP, IVA, IRE e IDU.</span></button><button class="need" data-filter-jump="finanzas"><span class="need-icon">₲</span><b>Ordenar mi plata</b><span>Presupuesto, monedas y objetivos.</span></button><button class="need" data-filter-jump="hogar"><span class="need-icon">⌂</span><b>Planificar una compra grande</b><span>Casa, auto, evento o viaje.</span></button></div></div></section>
`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-paraguay-home')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-paraguay-home');

const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id),cards=[...root.querySelectorAll(".calc-card")],filters=[...root.querySelectorAll(".filter")],fmt=n=>"Gs. "+Math.round(n).toLocaleString("de-DE");let currentFilter="all";
function salary(){let gross=Math.max(0,+$("salary").value||0),kids=Math.max(0,Math.floor(+$("children").value||0)),ips=gross*.09,bonus=gross<=6088000?kids*152200:0,net=gross-ips+bonus;$("salaryNet").textContent=fmt(net);$("salaryDetail").textContent=`IPS: − ${fmt(ips)} · ${bonus?`bonificación: + ${fmt(bonus)}`:"sin bonificación familiar"}`}
function applyFilter(cat="all",term=""){currentFilter=cat;let q=term.trim().toLowerCase(),visible=0;cards.forEach(c=>{let ok=(cat==="all"||c.dataset.cat===cat)&&(!q||c.dataset.search.includes(q)||c.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q));c.hidden=!ok;if(ok)visible++});filters.forEach(f=>f.classList.toggle("active",f.dataset.filter===cat));if(!visible)showToast("No encontramos esa cuenta. Probá con otra palabra.")}
function showToast(t){$("toast").textContent=t;$("toast").classList.add("show");setTimeout(()=>$("toast").classList.remove("show"),1800)}
$("salaryBtn").onclick=()=>{salary();showToast("✓ Sueldo actualizado")};[$("salary"),$("children")].forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",salary));filters.forEach(f=>f.onclick=()=>{$("search").value="";applyFilter(f.dataset.filter)});$("searchBtn").onclick=()=>{applyFilter("all",$("search").value);root.querySelector(".main").scrollIntoView()};$("search").addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Enter")$("searchBtn").click()});$("headerSearch").onclick=()=>{$("search").focus();$("search").scrollIntoView({block:"center"})};root.querySelectorAll(".open").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>showToast(`Abriría: ${b.dataset.page}`));root.querySelectorAll(".need").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{$("search").value="";applyFilter(b.dataset.filterJump);root.querySelector(".main").scrollIntoView()});salary();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-paraguay-home{--ink:#111b31;--muted:#677286;--paper:#f6f7f4;--card:#fff;--red:#d84a55;--red2:#fdebec;--blue:#3568c9;--blue2:#eaf1ff;--green:#258267;--navy:#173151;--gold:#d9a441;--line:#dde2e1}
.mockup-paraguay-home *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-paraguay-home [hidden]{display:none!important}.mockup-paraguay-home{scroll-behavior:smooth}.mockup-paraguay-home{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.45 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}.mockup-paraguay-home button,.mockup-paraguay-home input{font:inherit}.mockup-paraguay-home .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}
.mockup-paraguay-home header{height:84px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-paraguay-home header .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px}.mockup-paraguay-home .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:850;font-size:20px}.mockup-paraguay-home .logo{width:35px;height:35px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--navy);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.mockup-paraguay-home .nav{display:flex;gap:26px;color:#4f5969;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.mockup-paraguay-home .actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px}.mockup-paraguay-home .ghost{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;padding:11px 15px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:750;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.mockup-paraguay-home .hero{padding:58px 0 54px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f0f4fb);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-50px;top:0;width:38%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(#d64952 0 33%,#fff 33% 66%,#315fc2 66%);opacity:.05}.mockup-paraguay-home .crumb{color:#4a75c1;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:19px}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:65px;align-items:center}.mockup-paraguay-home .eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:var(--blue)}.mockup-paraguay-home h1{font-size:58px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 18px}.mockup-paraguay-home .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:680px}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-search{display:flex;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:6px;margin-top:27px;max-width:640px;box-shadow:0 14px 35px #273a5013}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-search input{border:0;outline:0;padding:13px 14px;flex:1;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-search button{border:0;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:11px;padding:0 19px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}
.mockup-paraguay-home .flag-card{height:330px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.mockup-paraguay-home .flag{width:330px;height:210px;border-radius:23px;background:linear-gradient(#d84851 0 33.33%,#fff 33.33% 66.66%,#315fc2 66.66%);box-shadow:0 25px 55px #233a561f;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-paraguay-home .seal{position:absolute;width:82px;height:82px;border:5px double #b5a66c;border-radius:50%;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6c7d55;font-size:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:900}.mockup-paraguay-home .data-card{position:absolute;right:-3px;bottom:4px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:15px 18px;box-shadow:0 15px 35px #26394e20}.mockup-paraguay-home .data-card small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em}.mockup-paraguay-home .data-card strong{font-size:25px;color:var(--blue)}
.mockup-paraguay-home .quick{margin-top:-18px;position:relative;z-index:3}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-grid{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;box-shadow:0 20px 55px #20374c13;overflow:hidden}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-form{padding:27px 30px}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-form h2{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-form p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 19px}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:10px}.mockup-paraguay-home .qfield label{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;display:block;margin-bottom:6px}.mockup-paraguay-home .qfield input{width:100%;border:1px solid #cfd6d5;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;outline:none}.mockup-paraguay-home .qfield input:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #3568c919}.mockup-paraguay-home .calcbtn{align-self:end;border:0;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:14px 17px;border-radius:11px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-result{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:27px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-result small{color:#a8bed7;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-result strong{font-size:34px;margin:6px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-result span{color:#d6dfeb;font-size:13px}
.mockup-paraguay-home .main{padding:68px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:27px}.mockup-paraguay-home .section-head h2{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:7px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .section-head p{color:var(--muted);max-width:550px;margin:0}.mockup-paraguay-home .filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:23px}.mockup-paraguay-home .filter{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:9px 13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:800;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.mockup-paraguay-home .filter.active{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}.mockup-paraguay-home .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.mockup-paraguay-home .calc-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:21px;min-height:180px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.15s}.mockup-paraguay-home .calc-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #21364911}.mockup-paraguay-home .card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.mockup-paraguay-home .card-icon{width:39px;height:39px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--blue2);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--blue);font-weight:900}.mockup-paraguay-home .tag{font-size:10px;background:#f0f2f1;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:850}.mockup-paraguay-home .calc-card h3{font-size:18px;margin:14px 0 6px}.mockup-paraguay-home .calc-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 17px}.mockup-paraguay-home .open{margin-top:auto;border:0;background:transparent;text-align:left;padding:0;color:var(--blue);font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}
.mockup-paraguay-home .facts{background:#eef1ed;padding:67px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .facts-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:65px}.mockup-paraguay-home .facts h2{font-size:40px;line-height:1.08;margin:10px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .facts p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact-list{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:19px;overflow:hidden}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:20px;padding:17px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact:last-child{border:0}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact strong{text-align:right}.mockup-paraguay-home .source{font-size:10px!important;color:#8791a0!important;display:block}
.mockup-paraguay-home .needs{padding:68px 0}.mockup-paraguay-home .need-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:13px}.mockup-paraguay-home .need{border:0;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:21px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-paraguay-home .need:hover{border-color:var(--blue)}.mockup-paraguay-home .need-icon{font-size:23px}.mockup-paraguay-home .need b{display:block;margin:12px 0 5px}.mockup-paraguay-home .need span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.mockup-paraguay-home .toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:25px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:750;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s;z-index:10}.mockup-paraguay-home .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.mockup-paraguay-home footer{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:850px){.mockup-paraguay-home .nav{display:none}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-grid,.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-grid,.mockup-paraguay-home .facts-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-paraguay-home .flag-card{height:280px}.mockup-paraguay-home .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-paraguay-home .need-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-paraguay-home h1{font-size:46px}}@media(max-width:540px){.mockup-paraguay-home .wrap{padding:0 18px}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero{padding-top:35px}.mockup-paraguay-home .flag-card{display:none}.mockup-paraguay-home h1{font-size:40px}.mockup-paraguay-home .quick-fields,.mockup-paraguay-home .cards,.mockup-paraguay-home .need-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-paraguay-home .section-head{display:block}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-paraguay-home .fact strong{text-align:left}.mockup-paraguay-home .hero-search button{padding:0 13px}}

.mockup-paraguay-home { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .top, .mockup-paraguay-home header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real p { color:#687a8f; line-height:1.65; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-paraguay-home .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-paraguay-home support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
